    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2266" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀΐδρυτος</span></b>  or (more freq.) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνίδρυτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unsettled, unstable</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρόμοι ἀν</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				971
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνοι</span>
			<i>irregular</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Interrog.</u>
				12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄοικοι καὶ ἀν</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>TG</u>
				9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῆσος ἀν</span>.
			<i>floating</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀν. τῆς γνώμης, τῆς
			οὐσίας</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.112
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				413
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>with no fixed abode</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τίμων ἦν ἀ. τις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					809
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσπειστος, ἀν</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.52
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκοῠσιν φεύγοντες, ἀ. κακὸν ἄλλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					209
				</span></i>
			 (expl. by 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃ οὺκ ἄν τις αὑτῷ ἱδρύσαιτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					42.10
				</span></i>
			).</div>
